# Common Patterns

## Tech Stack

- Nuxt 4, Vue 3, Nuxt UI 4, Tailwind v4
- tRPC, Drizzle ORM (SQLite/D1)
- Cloudflare R2, Vectorize, Queues, KV
- Better Auth
- TypeScript (strict mode)

## Style

- No semicolons, trailing commas, 100 char lines, single quotes

## Frontend

- Use `<script setup lang="ts">`
- Prefix components: `Table*.vue`, `Form*.vue`, `App*.vue`
- Fetch data at page level with `useAsyncData` or `$trpc.*.useQuery()`
- Child components are presentational (dumb)
- Use Lucide icons: `i-lucide-*`
- Use Simple icons for brand icons: `i-simple-icons-*`
- Use `~~/` for root imports

## Backend

- Tables prefixed with `T`, relations with `R`
- Keep tRPC procedures thin; logic in `server/lib/` or `server/utils/`
- Context: `ctx.db`, `ctx.storage`, `ctx.vector`, `ctx.queue`, `ctx.session`

